Spec: SpecDD support module
Purpose:
  Parse and inspect current-dialect SpecDD ownership contracts for Deliver.
Platform: Node.js 22 or newer
Owns:
  ./scripts/specdd.mjs
  ./assets/specdd
  ./tests/specdd.test.mjs
Can modify:
  ./fixtures
Exposes:
  parseSpec(text)
  inspectSpecs(root, specPaths)
Must:
  Resolve ./ and ../ from each spec directory and / from the content root.
  Keep prose in Owns out of filesystem ownership.
  Use Owns and Can modify as the editable union while keeping Owns exclusive.
Done when:
  Literal traversal and symlink escapes are rejected.
  Inspection performs no writes.
